; ---- MOVE: written by hand, kept by tools/mw1bounds.py ----
; mw3c4 (MW3's Gorge): its own yellow's south side runs from (2294 126) to (-1149 493). ia3's four southern places
; stand 400-650 m past it and past the red; ia1's Enemy_01 70 m past the yellow, its Enemy_03 28 m inside it. Each
; goes at least 150 m inside the yellow. ia3's keep their distance from the tower its fail block watches (iatowv2;
; iatower at 1179 896): 1.05-1.28 km before, 1.0-1.45 km here, two east and two west along the south side. Brought
; straight north (430 m from it) they took it down while the player stood (mw1_loop_boundary_escape_headless).
MOVE (WORLD ("mw3c4") IA (3) FROM (1042 -154) TO (2000 360))
MOVE (WORLD ("mw3c4") IA (3) FROM (1045 -252) TO (2100 420))
